<title>MALAYSIA: Island &amp; Peninsular year net up.</title>
<headline>Island &amp; Peninsular year net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>			 (in milllion ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 81.87	   vs	  67.70</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	71.5	    vs	  59.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		  466.02	   vs	 412.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  153.34	   vs	 133.94</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     35.71	   vs  less  37.08</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries loss    0.30	   vs	  nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 22.0	    vs	  22.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Island &amp; Peninsular's businesses include property development and reinvestment and production of palm oil and rubber.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
